{
"file": 62,
"paths": [
"d007/d000/f229"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "cd1a0c44",
"en_raw": "Hey, Hirauchi"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "a665b44d",
"en_raw": "did you see the last Crusader?"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "7e2276cc",
"en_raw": "Maybe I did see it"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "ee14185e",
"en_raw": "Yo, Inagaki"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "217a1cbf",
"en_raw": "What are you doing?"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "55bccd90",
"en_raw": "Oh, oh, Hirauchi~"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "a665b44d",
"en_raw": "did you see the last Crusader?"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "7e2276cc",
"en_raw": "Maybe I did see it"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "bd73ddbe",
"en_raw": "Hey, Inagaki..."
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "126bc378",
"en_raw": "Hey, Inagaki"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "46719dbc",
"en_raw": "Tell me about it in detail"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "371de298",
"en_raw": "So the Student Council President"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "3e06172e",
"en_raw": "was a robot after all"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "494db0cf",
"en_raw": "Huh..."
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "d09537b5",
"en_raw": "'Huh,' she says, it's exactly"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "64035b44",
"en_raw": "how you said it'd go"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "e97451f6",
"en_raw": "I thought it'd be the worst"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "aed59d01",
"en_raw": "if that happened"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "3d1e1152",
"en_raw": "so I just said it out loud"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "2d45131d",
"en_raw": "That's kind of amazing"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "885ef506",
"en_raw": "Then that girl Kisana..."
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "5ccd3203",
"en_raw": "...Anyway, Inagaki"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "d2057889",
"en_raw": "don't you ever have"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "aa59e7a1",
"en_raw": "topics besides anime?"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "0949d76d",
"en_raw": "...Huh?"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "33f4fa9f",
"en_raw": "Other topics, you mean?"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "bfc35f9c",
"en_raw": "Let me think, hmm"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "34cf0292",
"en_raw": "........"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "27647eca",
"en_raw": "Um, well, let's see"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "e505b249",
"en_raw": "Do you know that one?"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "cbfdf87b",
"en_raw": "The cursed antique shop rumor"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "7c0d9aa2",
"en_raw": "What's that?"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "5b1f63e3",
"en_raw": "I only"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "5365ea5c",
"en_raw": "heard a bit about it"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "aa215a7c",
"en_raw": "...Are the goods cursed"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "17c8a20f",
"en_raw": "...or the shop itself?"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "28236355",
"en_raw": "Anyway, apparently"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "e6463b9f",
"en_raw": "it's cursed somehow"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "cab21352",
"en_raw": "Frankly, you"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "a7acfddb",
"en_raw": "made that up, didn't you?"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "13ec81b2",
"en_raw": "No way~"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "d173b4a2",
"en_raw": "It's in a row of bars by the station"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "b2549c3a",
"en_raw": "and from what I know alone, it's changed"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "e02b1fa5",
"en_raw": "shops four times"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "a763a17c",
"en_raw": "There must be some strange history"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "fdc78002",
"en_raw": "attached to it"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "06957b36",
"en_raw": "By the station... bars...?"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "6c8dd7e9",
"en_raw": "Where are you talking about?"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "5a91a85d",
"en_raw": "I mean the one by the station, next to"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "7a65a178",
"en_raw": "the pasta place..."
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "aa99a4d8",
"en_raw": "What do you call"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "9778c105",
"en_raw": "those kinds of buildings?"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "fac69bb1",
"en_raw": "A mixed-use building"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "49f85a6a",
"en_raw": "...was it?"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "a22d6604",
"en_raw": "That's the building"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "9fbcac05",
"en_raw": "with the used bookstore I often go to"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "00923201",
"en_raw": "So there was such a rumor about it"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "38949a27",
"en_raw": "Right, right, surprising, isn't it?"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "cc859f66",
"en_raw": "Obtained the rumor of the Cursed Antiques"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "3abad9ee",
"en_raw": "By the way, that used bookstore"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "cc006882",
"en_raw": "since Hirauchi goes there"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "a7bfc61a",
"en_raw": "does it have a good selection?"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "82f29a9b",
"en_raw": "If possible, I'd like you to take me"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "c3a62a1e",
"en_raw": "along too, or so..."
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "b622305f",
"en_raw": "Maybe in the next life"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "0d6720e4",
"en_raw": "Oh, sorry"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "73e6e848",
"en_raw": "It's boring, isn't it..."
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "d022b4be",
"en_raw": "...Not allowed, right?"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "988f40d1",
"en_raw": "Sorry~"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "13b93f99",
"en_raw": "Hey, the place you mentioned..."
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "44cf3465",
"en_raw": "It's inside the mixed-use building by the station"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "716a1dcf",
"en_raw": "Thanks"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "d1146f62",
"en_raw": "Please let me join you next time~"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "7be7e478",
"en_raw": "Sorry, not right now..."
}
]
}